      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "A person from a photo speaks a script in two takes with LTX, one segment node per take. The first segment holds the photo, and the scene that casts the voice and the delivery for every take. Each segment's prompt is the words spoken. With seconds at 0, a take lasts as long as its script needs at the pace; set seconds to pin its length, and a take longer than its script holds the person in a quiet, idle presence to the end.\n\nLTX prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/ltx/prompt-guide\n\nSet your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "A person from a photo speaks a script in two takes with LTX, one segment node per take. The first segment holds the photo, and the scene that casts the voice and the delivery for every take. Each segment's prompt is the words spoken. With seconds at 0, a take lasts as long as its script needs at the pace; set seconds to pin its length, and a take longer than its script holds the person in a quiet, idle presence to the end.\n\nLTX prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/ltx/prompt-guide\n\nSet your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
